      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T09:39:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "description of PLATFORM_EC_BODY_DETECTION_VAR_THRESHOLD:\n\"The threshold of acceleration variance for confidence calculation\"\n\ndescription of PLATFORM_EC_BODY_DETECTION_CONFIDENCE_DELTA:\n\"The delta of acceleration variance for confidence calculation\"\n\nBoth Help:\nThe unit is (mm/s^2)^2\n\nThe motion confidence is calculated if the variance is within variance_threshold +/- confidence_delta. Otherwise. if variance is too high/low, confidence will be 100%/0%.",
      "parentUuid": "b0537133_759523be",
